+## Iteration Trace
+
+| Step | Added component | Match corr | rel_residual | Residual peaks | Cumulative components |
+|---|---|---:|---:|---:|---|
+| 0 | Diopside | 0.843 | 0.5375 | 28 | ['Diopside'] |
